{"path":"skills/comprehende/references/example.md","ref":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":1,"text":"# Example review.json"},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":3,"text":"Optional filled sample. The field shape in `SKILL.md` is enough to write a document. Paths come from `comprehende review`. When a file is split, `oldStart` and `newStart` come from that hunk's `@@` header."},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"485af33aa95c0814b0966b01eb39fce2377d2f3b","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1787548159,"line":5,"text":"- `login` depends on `cookie`. Both use `part` \"Session cookie\"."},{"sha":"485af33aa95c0814b0966b01eb39fce2377d2f3b","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1787548159,"line":6,"text":"- `docs` is a separate part, last in `suggestedOrder`, because it could have been its own pull request."},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":7,"text":"- Ticket #12 names why this work exists, so document `why` is present. Document `title` keeps the ticket title. Document `summary` names both stories. Document `parts` holds a one-sentence what per story. The why cites the ticket with `[#12](source:s1)`."},{"sha":"485af33aa95c0814b0966b01eb39fce2377d2f3b","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1787548159,"line":8,"text":"- `login` `summary` names how those hunks meet. `login` `lookFor` is a predicted trace. `docs` has no `lookFor`."},{"sha":"4167e5fece3f0b0fa6a8a5c21d1381319dc363d5","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1789328214,"line":9,"text":"- Document `lookFor` compares ticket #12 with the diff: work the ticket asks for that no hunk does, and one claim about the whole change. Both cite `[#12](source:s1)`. Group `lookFor` stays inside its hunks."},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":10,"text":"- Each group holds every hunk of its file, so each `hunkRefs` entry is that path. A split file uses `path@oldStart+newStart` (`old/path -> new/path@oldStart+newStart` when renamed)."},{"sha":"aaa8ad266ed698df6cdbb8ead0d2c0de5a01f757","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786996490,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":12,"text":"```json"},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":13,"text":"{"},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":14,"text":"  \"version\": 1,"},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":15,"text":"  \"source\": {"},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":16,"text":"    \"baseRef\": \"origin/main\","},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":17,"text":"    \"headRef\": \"HEAD\","},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":18,"text":"    \"range\": \"origin/main...HEAD\""},{"sha":"86df412493076d5477c9117ade661ca6b37cc0a3","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1786673228,"line":19,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"5c713233ac7998a896201cef62027b5b4e3a2bd7","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1786706250,"line":20,"text":"  \"size\": \"small\","},{"sha":"44e2062c1553d669a0d864cb9f83b83dd4570ba2","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1787981606,"line":21,"text":"  \"title\": \"HttpOnly session cookies\","},{"sha":"b54d023c0f97ec407bf072b71fa5cab69aa00cf1","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1788073364,"line":22,"text":"  \"why\": \"[#12](source:s1) requires login sessions that client scripts cannot read.\","},{"sha":"485af33aa95c0814b0966b01eb39fce2377d2f3b","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1787548159,"line":23,"text":"  \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies HttpOnly cookie options, and the login route uses it. The README documents this behavior.\","},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":24,"text":"  \"parts\": ["},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":25,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":26,"text":"      \"name\": \"Session cookie\","},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":27,"text":"      \"summary\": \"`setSessionCookie` applies HttpOnly cookie options, and the login route uses it.\""},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":28,"text":"    },"},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":29,"text":"    {"},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":30,"text":"      \"name\": \"README\","},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":31,"text":"      \"summary\": \"The README documents the new session cookie behavior.\""},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":32,"text":"    }"},{"sha":"d5011fce325fb0b8497129914cd9f56404c53218","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790142358,"line":33,"text":"  ],"},{"sha":"b54d023c0f97ec407bf072b71fa5cab69aa00cf1","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1788073364,"line":34,"text":"  \"sources\": ["},{"sha":"7